/**
 * `agent-sdk deploy | deployments | deployment | stop | rollback | delete | rotate-token |
 * secrets set|list|unset` — Heroku-style deploys
 * onto Cursor's managed agent-serve hosting.
 *
 * All intelligence is server-side. These handlers resolve parameters (credentials, team, slug, the project's
 * `hosting` / `architecture` manifest block), call the v2 agentsdk
 * management API through `deploy-client.ts`, poll status, and render.
 * `deployment`, `stop`, and `delete` keep a v1 fallback so the owner of a
 * live v1 deployment can still see, stop, or remove it.
 */
